Axis is now using those real-world demonstrations as seeds for simulation, multiplying scarce robot data into training environments at scale

This “real → sim → model → real” loop is becoming one of the most important flywheels in Physical AI

Axis also announced they’re deploying subnet 4 on @BitRobotNetwork recently who I’m following closely (think TAO purely for robotics) 

